    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Invoices significantly past their due date that remain in Posted status.
Why it matters: Aged AR accumulates silently — collections doesn&apos;t escalate, the customer relationship drifts, and bad-debt write-offs are sprung at month-end. Often a sign of missing dunning automation.
Suppress a finding: when the invoice is in active dispute and accounts have agreed to hold collections.
Disable the detector: only if your AR aging is tracked outside Billing. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
